    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A Lourdes Grotto is a replication of the original Grotto of Massabielle near Lourdes, France, where Maria is said to have appeared to a local girl. Such replications consist of a (usually man-made) cave or cave replica, sometimes lifesize, sometimes just a few decimetres high, with a statue of Maria inside.</skos:scopeNote>
